{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>נרדה</b> Three times in the Masorah: here, and the others נרדה ונבלה שם שפתם, נרדה אחר פלשתים לילה. He said: if he sends us, נרדה immediately, and we go down by day and by night to hasten the matter, just as there — נרדה לילה. And also a hint to what they expounded: that they went down to kill the land of Egypt, as written: נרדה ונבלה שם שפתם."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 43, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:16.103684363Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}